  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land Administration II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to improve land tenure security and land transactions by providing efficientcomma equitablecomma and accessible land administration services. This will facilitate better land-related investments and more productive and environmentally sustainable land use.  Land administration services include massivecomma systematic land regularization (i.e.comma dissemination campaigncomma mappingcomma verification of rightscomma delimitation of propertiescomma field conflict resolutioncomma notification of resultscomma transfer of information to SIRyCcomma and titling in areas of social interest) as well as day-to-day integrated cadastral and property registry services (e.g.comma individual title registrationcomma cadastral certificate emissions)</narrative>
  </description>
